# Security Implementation Manual
**Status:** Finalizing Rules (v4.0+)

## 1. Authorization Matrix
| Action | Viewer | Artist | Admin | Enforcement |
| :--- | :---: | :---: | :---: | :--- |
| Read Profiles | $\checkmark$ | $\checkmark$ | $\checkmark$ | Rules |
| Update Own Profile | $\checkmark$ | $\checkmark$ | $\checkmark$ | Rules (Limited Keys) |
| Go Live | $\times$ | $\checkmark$ | $\checkmark$ | Callable + Claim |
| Post Announcement | $\times$ | $\checkmark$ | $\checkmark$ | Rules + Claim |
